From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] Create the profile picture directory with octal mode 0755

gowhatsapp_handle_profile_picture() created the directory for a
profile picture with g_mkdir_with_parents(local_directory, 0x755).
0x755 is hexadecimal, which is mode 03525 (r-x-w-r-t), so the owner
cannot write to the directory. The profile picture is then never
saved, and since the path template is the one the auto-downloader
uses, an attachment that later goes into the same directory cannot be
saved either. Use 0755 instead.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/hoehermann/purple-gowhatsapp/pull/315]
---
 glue/presence.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/glue/presence.c b/glue/presence.c
index 559e110..915fa2c 100644
--- a/glue/presence.c
+++ b/glue/presence.c
@@ -58,7 +58,7 @@ gowhatsapp_handle_profile_picture(gowhatsapp_message_t *gwamsg)
         char *hash = ""; // not set for profile pictures
         char *local_file_path = gowhatsapp_attachment_fill_template(local_path_template, timestamp, hash, "profile", ".jpg", gwamsg->remoteJid, gwamsg->remoteJid, buddy_alias, buddy_alias, gwamsg->messageId, PURPLE_MESSAGE_RECV);
         char *local_directory = g_path_get_dirname(local_file_path);
-        if (0 == g_mkdir_with_parents(local_directory, 0x755)) {
+        if (0 == g_mkdir_with_parents(local_directory, 0755)) {
             GError* error = NULL;
             gboolean success = g_file_set_contents(local_file_path, gwamsg->blob, gwamsg->blobsize, &error);
             // success not checked, errors ignored silently
